{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"fangji-e-c71b4320000c0aa1c693","title":"初郤俭之至，市伏苓价暴数倍","accounts":[{"id":"fangji-a-c71b4320000c0aa1c693","label":"裴注·典论","text":"初郤俭之至，市伏苓价暴数倍","evidence":["fangji-q-a3e0f64f7a96adf5bdb1"]}],"participants":[{"person":"fangji-p-f44473a9d4c7c6","role":"至者","evidence":["fangji-q-a3e0f64f7a96adf5bdb1"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["fangji-q-a3e0f64f7a96adf5bdb1"]},"ordering_evidence":"fangji-q-a3e0f64f7a96adf5bdb1","order":5914},{"id":"fangji-e-71fd8ab4298a7656f839","title":"曹植试郤俭绝谷百日，躬与之寝处，行步起居自若","accounts":[{"id":"fangji-a-71fd8ab4298a7656f839","label":"裴注·辩道论","text":"曹植试郤俭绝谷百日，躬与之寝处，行步起居自若","evidence":["fangji-q-d573fb76ee16c10a76bd"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0280","role":"试者","evidence":["fangji-q-d573fb76ee16c10a76bd"]},{"person":"fangji-p-f44473a9d4c7c6","role":"被试绝谷者","evidence":["fangji-q-d573fb76ee16c10a76bd"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["fangji-q-d573fb76ee16c10a76bd"]},"ordering_evidence":"fangji-q-d573fb76ee16c10a76bd","order":5924}],"persons":[{"id":"fangji-p-f44473a9d4c7c6","name":"郤俭（方士）","evidence":["fangji-q-a3e0f64f7a96adf5bdb1","fangji-q-d573fb76ee16c10a76bd","fangji-q-d9499780db6b1117e7cf"],"facts":[],"mentions":[{"id":"fangji-m-513dd8761c820e03dda9","kind":"mention","text":"曹丕《典论》述并议方士及好道者","evidence":["fangji-q-d9499780db6b1117e7cf"]}],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"fangji-q-a3e0f64f7a96adf5bdb1","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-03fdb056126f24c96814","layer":"pei","quote":"初，俭之至，市伏苓，价暴数倍","attribution":"裴注·典论","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":150,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-66c2e7fedf68bad14c99","start":58,"end":72},{"id":"fangji-q-d573fb76ee16c10a76bd","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-8ffe9977ab1dad3d73e6","layer":"pei","quote":"余尝试郤俭：绝谷百日，躬与之寝处，行步起居，自若也","attribution":"裴注·辩道论","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":151,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-66c2e7fedf68bad14c99","start":210,"end":235},{"id":"fangji-q-d9499780db6b1117e7cf","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-03fdb056126f24c96814","layer":"pei","quote":"文帝《典论》论郤俭等事曰：“颍川郤俭，能辟谷，饵伏苓；甘陵甘始，亦善行气，老有少容；庐江左慈，知补导之术：并为军吏。初，俭之至，市伏苓，价暴数倍。议郎安平李覃，学其辟谷，餐伏苓，饮寒水；中泄利，殆至陨命。后，始来，众人无不鸱视狼顾，呼吸吐纳。军谋祭酒弘农董芬，为之过差，气闭不通，良久乃苏。左慈到，又竞受其补导之术；至寺人严峻，往从问受，阉竖真无事于斯术也。人之逐声，乃至于是。光和中，北海王和平，亦好道术，自以当仙。济南孙邕，少事之，从至京师。会和平病死，邕因葬之东陶；有书百余卷，药数囊，悉以送之。后弟子夏荣，言其尸解；邕至今恨不取其宝书仙药。刘向惑于《鸿宝》之说，君游眩于子政之言，古今愚谬，岂唯一人哉！”","attribution":"裴注引曹丕《典论》","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":150,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-66c2e7fedf68bad14c99","start":0,"end":306}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
